B.UN=new A.H(B.r,["Place names, categories and addresses come from Overture Maps Places data. The data is licensed per record: Foursquare (FSQ OS Places) records under Apache-2.0, other sources under CDLA-Permissive-2.0 and AllThePlaces records under CC0 1.0; the Apache-2.0 and CDLA-Permissive-2.0 texts are reproduced in full below. Notice of changes: YuMapAI modified this data (normalized names, categories and addresses, matched and merged records with other sources, added province and district). Dates of changes: September\u2013November 2026, last updated 18.11.2026.","Mek\xe2n adlar\u0131, kategorileri ve adresleri Overture Maps Places verisinden gelir. Veri kay\u0131t baz\u0131nda lisansl\u0131d\u0131r: Foursquare (FSQ OS Places) kaynakl\u0131 kay\u0131tlar Apache-2.0, di\u011fer kaynaklar CDLA-Permissive-2.0, AllThePlaces kaynakl\u0131 kay\u0131tlar CC0 1.0 ile lisansl\u0131d\u0131r; Apache-2.0 ve CDLA-Permissive-2.0 metinleri a\u015fa\u011f\u0131da tam olarak yer al\u0131r. De\u011fi\u015fiklik beyan\u0131: YuMapAI bu verileri de\u011fi\u015ftirmi\u015ftir (ad, kategori ve adres alanlar\u0131 normalize edildi, kay\u0131tlar ba\u015fka kaynaklarla e\u015fle\u015ftirilip birle\u015ftirildi, il ve il\xe7e bilgisi eklendi). De\u011fi\u015fiklik tarihleri: Eyl\xfcl\u2013Kas\u0131m 2026, son g\xfcncelleme 18.11.2026."],t.w)
